#: ../../tools/pharmgkb_tools.rst:71 da00d4be50c24cb1a65e426eb759c32d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get pharmacogenetic dosing guidelines (CPIC/DPWG) from "
"PharmGKB by guideline\\_id. IMPORTANT: use the 'clinpgxid' field from "
"CPIC\\_list\\_guidelines (e.g., 'PA166251454'), NOT the 'pharmgkbid' "
"field — old-format pharmgkbid values (e.g., 'PA166104996') return HTTP "
"404. The test example PA166251465 is for the warfarin guideline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pharmgkb_tools.rst:75 458dd5a524414d078b466c974b5d4905
msgid ""
"``guideline_id`` (string) (required) PharmGKB ClinPGx guideline ID from "
"CPIC\\_list\\_guidelines 'clinpgxid' field (e.g., 'PA166251465' for "
"warfarin, 'PA166251454' for opioids/codeine, 'PA166251458' for "
"tamoxifen). Use clinpgxid, NOT pharmgkbid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pharmgkb_tools.rst:78 49ccb57999854ce9a600f148125cdf88
msgid ""
"``gene`` (string) (optional) Gene symbol (e.g., 'CYP2D6'). NOTE: "
"Filtering by gene symbol is unreliable and may return a generic prompt "
"instead of actual guidelines. Use guideline\\_id instead."
msgstr ""

